ABSTRACT

DocuTrack Pro: A Cloud-Based Document Management System

This thesis presents the design and implementation of DocuTrack Pro, a comprehensive cloud-based document management system developed to streamline organizational document processing workflows. The system addresses critical challenges in traditional document management including inefficient processing workflows, lack of real-time visibility, security vulnerabilities, and limited collaboration capabilities.

Built using modern web technologies including React 18, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS for the frontend, the system integrates seamlessly with Amazon Web Services (AWS) cloud infrastructure, leveraging services such as Lambda functions, API Gateway, S3 storage, and RDS databases. The architecture follows a serverless microservices approach, ensuring scalability, cost-effectiveness, and maintainability.

The system implements role-based access control supporting three distinct user types: Clients/Users who submit documents, Processing Staff who handle document workflows, and Deputy Directors who oversee operations and analytics. Key features include automated document routing, real-time status tracking, intelligent notification systems, comprehensive reporting, and advanced security measures.

Development followed Agile methodology with iterative sprints, ensuring continuous stakeholder feedback and adaptive planning. The cloud deployment model utilizes AWS free tier services, making the solution accessible to organizations of varying sizes while maintaining enterprise-grade security and performance standards.

Testing and evaluation demonstrate significant improvements in document processing efficiency, with reduced processing times, enhanced transparency, and improved user satisfaction. The system successfully addresses identified gaps in existing solutions by providing cost-effective, role-optimized workflows specifically designed for document processing environments.

The DocuTrack Pro system represents a significant advancement in cloud-based document management, offering a scalable, secure, and user-friendly solution that can be adapted to various organizational contexts while leveraging the benefits of modern cloud computing infrastructure.

